abstract: >-
  MistakeMap is a learning-oriented application that transforms corrected
  exercises into a conceptual map of error patterns, recurrence, recovery,
  and evolution. The project is designed around Flutter and Dart with a
  Supabase/PostgreSQL backend, OCR/LLM-assisted classification, human
  validation, and a conceptual graph for evidence-based review prioritization.
